  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add curry paste and cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute.",
    "Add cod fillets and cook for 2-3 minutes per side, until cooked through.",
    "Remove cod from pan and set aside.",
    "Add coconut milk, gaeng kee-mao sauce, fish sauce, and sugar to pan.",
    "Bring to a simmer and cook for 2-3 minutes, until slightly thickened.",
    "Stir in Thai basil and lime juice.",
    "Serve cod with noodles and sauce.",
    "Garnish with additional Thai basil, if desired."
